      "id": "p108-title04",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "title",
      "block": "title",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "UPHEAVAL"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck01",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Bitcoin comes from the future. This is how Satoshi stays"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck02",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "anonymous. It's been floating around the void for eons, lots of"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck03",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "intelligent species looked at it, but not one of them picked up"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck04",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "on the beauty and practicality of how it encodes and enshrines"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck05",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "freedom by separating money from tyrants and other state"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck06",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 6,
      "printedText": "actors, giving sentient beings unconfiscatable property rights"
    },
    {
      "id": "p108-deck07",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "printedPage": 108,
      "role": "deck",
      "block": "deck",
      "lineInBlock": 7,
      "printedText": "with an intergalactically accepted store of value."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r001",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Barreling toward us from the future, Satoshi's BTC specs vectored for light years in the"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r002",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "cosmos like digital dandelion seeds, omnidirectionally, looking for some fertile intelligence"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r003",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "to impregnate with its impregnable simplicity, aesthetic charm, élan, forthrightness and"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r004",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "mathematical inevitability. Fortunately, here on Earth, (the blue dot 238,900 miles from"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r005",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "where this Bitcoin Magazine was dropped) the cypherpunks were primed for the BTC"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r006",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 6,
      "printedText": "message. They had been fighting and winning the encryption and privacy wars for years."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r007",
      "ordinal": 18,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "lead",
      "block": "lead",
      "lineInBlock": 7,
      "printedText": "Into their fertile unconscious minds, the BTC meme dropped and it started to germinate."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r008",
      "ordinal": 19,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "historians",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Historians may find this interesting. It was that nerdy SETI@home project — launched in"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r009",
      "ordinal": 20,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "historians",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "1999 by Berkeley researchers — that was responsible for humans winning the Satoshi lottery."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r010",
      "ordinal": 21,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "historians",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "SETI was a huge, global, distributed-computing-over-the-internet project sorting through"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r011",
      "ordinal": 22,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "historians",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "intergalactic radio waves looking for extraterrestrial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r012",
      "ordinal": 23,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "invisible",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Invisible to the millions of SETI project participants who had downloaded the program"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r013",
      "ordinal": 24,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "invisible",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "(and lent their hard drives to the project), the BTC meme slipped in through an open channel."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r014",
      "ordinal": 25,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "essentially",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Essentially, the specs for the Bitcoin white paper arrived unnoticed but were deeply felt by"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r015",
      "ordinal": 26,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "essentially",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "rebel cypherpunks. Now we got a full-blown, global economy built on perfect money up in"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r016",
      "ordinal": 27,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "essentially",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "here. Monetizing peace and love and demonetizing war and hate."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r017",
      "ordinal": 28,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "opposite",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "This is the opposite of the Big Bang, this is the Funky UpHeaval (FU), and it's coded to kill"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r018",
      "ordinal": 29,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "opposite",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "central banks, money center banks, banksters, derivative dealers, shady hedge funders,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r019",
      "ordinal": 30,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "opposite",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "crackpot academics, faux fiat media fluffers and pay-to-play intellectuals."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r020",
      "ordinal": 31,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "satoshi-display",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "SO, HELL TO THE YEAH, THANKS SATOSHI NAKAMOTO,"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r021",
      "ordinal": 32,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "satoshi-display",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "WE GOT THE MESSAGE-IN-A-PACKET YOU THREW"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r022",
      "ordinal": 33,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "satoshi-display",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "INTO THE COSMIC OCEAN LIKE A FLASH GRENADE."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r023",
      "ordinal": 34,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "satoshi-display",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "BAM! OCTOBER 31, 2008, THE WHITE PAPER APPEARS."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r024",
      "ordinal": 35,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "satoshi-display",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "BAM! JANUARY 3, 2009, THE GENESIS BLOCK WAS HASHED."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r025",
      "ordinal": 36,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Forget gold. Gold was the top store of value and medium of exchange for millennia but it's"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r026",
      "ordinal": 37,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "no longer fit for its purpose. It's fun to watch gold bugs publicly melt down on a daily"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r027",
      "ordinal": 38,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "basis. The realizations, rationalizations, hyperventilations and outright mendacity by the"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r028",
      "ordinal": 39,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "gold bugs justifying the failure of gold to keep up with inflation or even relevancy is truly"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r029",
      "ordinal": 40,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "bizarre. Meanwhile, Bitcoin powers ahead to parity with gold on a valuation basis around $9"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r030",
      "ordinal": 41,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "gold",
      "lineInBlock": 6,
      "printedText": "trillion before going much higher. Remember, Bitcoin has no top because fiat has no bottom."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r031",
      "ordinal": 42,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "nocoiners",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "The nocoiners are no better. Adoption by the wider, non-orange pilled nocoiner populous has been met"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r032",
      "ordinal": 43,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "nocoiners",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "with a wall of FUD (fear, uncertainty and doubt), but things are picking up now that El Salvador has made"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r033",
      "ordinal": 44,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "nocoiners",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "bitcoin legal tender and Nigeria, and the rest of Africa, are enjoying the benefits of hyperbitcoinization."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r034",
      "ordinal": 45,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "Humans have actually been de-evolving since 1971 when a global fiat money standard experiment was"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r035",
      "ordinal": 46,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "tried with sovereign fiat currencies inferring value from other fiat money ad nauseam turning us into"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r036",
      "ordinal": 47,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "consumer zombies. A daisy chain of fake money copulating with other fake money, breeding more"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r037",
      "ordinal": 48,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "fake money. A mobius strip of financialization that became a multi-quadrillion Ponzi scheme led by"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r038",
      "ordinal": 49,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "fiat potentates where all fiat money sins are forgiven by central bank priests wielding the power of their"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r039",
      "ordinal": 50,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 6,
      "printedText": "papal paper money indulgences, guaranteeing corrupt bankers a place in fiat heaven and exoneration"
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r040",
      "ordinal": 51,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "humans",
      "lineInBlock": 7,
      "printedText": "from all their fiat money sins."
    },
    {
      "id": "p109-r041",
      "ordinal": 52,
      "printedPage": 109,
      "role": "display-emphasis",
      "block": "bitcoin-fixes-this",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "BITCOIN FIXES THIS."
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r001",
      "ordinal": 53,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "It should be noted that some early Bitcoin adopters went insane. Bitcoin Derangement Syndrome"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r002",
      "ordinal": 54,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "(BDS) strikes when you least expect it. These OGs went full-blown Colonel Kurtz all the way up"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r003",
      "ordinal": 55,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "the river of their own egomaniacal, narcissistic, self-immolating shitcoin hell. They hard-forked"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r004",
      "ordinal": 56,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "Satoshi's only gift to us and air-dropped Frankencoins with no hash power and no reason to exist"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r005",
      "ordinal": 57,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 5,
      "printedText": "other than to confuse noobs. They created centralized, command-and-control copycats by"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r006",
      "ordinal": 58,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 6,
      "printedText": "the thousands. \"Smart contracts,\" \"world computer,\" \"proof-of-stake\" charlatans are preying on"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r007",
      "ordinal": 59,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 7,
      "printedText": "the stupidity of most people not to see through the con of unit bias, losing their lunch money and"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r008",
      "ordinal": 60,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "body",
      "block": "early-adopters",
      "lineInBlock": 8,
      "printedText": "then, after a rug pull, in a blaze of vomitous liquidations and bankruptcies, losing their lunch."
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r009",
      "ordinal": 61,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "attributed-quotation",
      "block": "hayek",
      "lineInBlock": 1,
      "printedText": "FRIEDRICH HAYEK SAID, \"I DON'T"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r010",
      "ordinal": 62,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "attributed-quotation",
      "block": "hayek",
      "lineInBlock": 2,
      "printedText": "BELIEVE WE SHALL EVER HAVE A"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r011",
      "ordinal": 63,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "attributed-quotation",
      "block": "hayek",
      "lineInBlock": 3,
      "printedText": "GOOD MONEY AGAIN BEFORE WE"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r012",
      "ordinal": 64,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "attributed-quotation",
      "block": "hayek",
      "lineInBlock": 4,
      "printedText": "TAKE THE THING OUT OF THE HANDS"
    },
    {
      "id": "p110-r013",
      "ordinal": 65,
      "printedPage": 110,
      "role": "attributed-quotation",
